  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility study comparing three not-in-kind technologies for use in central AC in Kuwait</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The focus of the feasibility study is a full comparative analysis of three not-in-kind technologies: deep sea water free cooling, waste heat absorption and solar assisted chilled water absorption systems, to determine which may be the most promising option for central air-conditioning systems. KUW/REF/75/TAS/28</narrative>
  </description>
